_assets/steam/apps/3304390/extras/d8f08cb4695deb954b858a8223037e83.webm?t=1737056856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304390/extras/d8f08cb4695deb954b858a8223037e83.mp4?t=1737056856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the uses of Rock Fragments is using them to construct blueprints you find throughout your experience. Rebuild fallen structures and interact with select ones to customize them. For example you can find blueprints that hold plants in different areas, unlocking one will allow you to start collecting Seed Packets! Open each for a spin on the roulette wheel to see what plant you discover then equip it to a pot to be planted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304390/extras/7d66b043541210b3446a5b18dfaa8725.poster.avif?t=1737056856\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304390/extras/7d66b043541210b3446a5b18dfaa8725.webm?t=1737056856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304390/extras/7d66b043541210b3446a5b18dfaa8725.mp4?t=1737056856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you feel the loneliness getting to you, you'll find an unexpected connection within the darkness. Two souls brought together, one fallen from heaven the other clawing out from Plato's Cavern. Together you'll shine light of truth onto the unknown and make atonements as you piece together the past in hope of a shining peaceful future together.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to Dusty Dunes Tycoon! A VR Gemstone Tycoon game. Unlock and upgrade unique Droppers and explore different areas each with unique attractions. Grab a pickaxe and hit the mines, grab a brush and polish some geodes, or strap up and hit the range, there's much to experience!",
